    "breadcrumb": "AWS Workshop Report \u003e Workshop",
    "content": "Using Gateway endpoint\rIn this section, you will create a Gateway eendpoint to access Amazon S3 from an EC2 instance. The Gateway endpoint will allow upload an object to S3 buckets without using the Public Internet. To create an endpoint, you must specify the VPC in which you want to create the endpoint, and the service (in this case, S3) to which you want to establish the connection.\nContent\rCreate gateway endpoint Test gateway endpoint",
    "description": "Using Gateway endpoint\rIn this section, you will create a Gateway eendpoint to access Amazon S3 from an EC2 instance. The Gateway endpoint will allow upload an object to S3 buckets without using the Public Internet. To create an endpoint, you must specify the VPC in which you want to create the endpoint, and the service (in this case, S3) to which you want to establish the connection.",
