    "breadcrumb": "AWS Workshop Report \u003e 1. Internship Worklog",
    "content": "Week 4: VPC Network Infrastructure (11/05 - 17/05)\rDay Tasks Start Date Completion Date Source Material Mon Learn about VPC configuration 11/05/2026 11/05/2026 - Tue Set up Subnets 12/05/2026 12/05/2026 - Wed Configure Security Group 13/05/2026 13/05/2026 - Thu Verify network connectivity 14/05/2026 14/05/2026 - Fri Update demo application 15/05/2026 15/05/2026 - Key Achievements:\rDeveloped a mindset for network infrastructure on AWS, clearly understanding the importance of network segmentation using VPC and Subnets. Learned how to set up effective network security layers to isolate and protect instances within.",
